@title Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (USA)
@file Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (U) [!].gba
@game A3AE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen mgba,nba
@save skip: the cart gets only its boot-time records until a stage is cleared; the first save needs 1-1 played to the goal ring (saved on the return to the map). Not reached: after the first bush column (cleared by a flutter jump from the white rock) and the egg-block bridge, a white rock overhangs the next mound and the flutter from the column top lands below it (below_white_block); the log bridge with the up arrow on top of that mound was not reached

# Soft reset, then Single Player > Yoshi's Island > FILE A > story (A every
# 40) > 1-1: the message block, eat the two Shy Guys on the log bridge (B,
# DOWN for eggs), over the bush hill, onto the white rock, jump + flutter onto
# the first bush column (column_top), flutter right.
# The soft reset (A+B+SELECT+START at f150, after the first boot's EEPROM
# format) is there for docs/playtest-bugs.md "Super Mario Advance 3: 1-1
# after a soft reset" (and §36): on a blank cart the boot formats the EEPROM
# with 196 polled block writes, so the frame the boot ends on is the chip's
# programming time (dingbat GBATEK's 108368 cycles, mgba ~115000, the second
# reference ~101000) and 1-1 was seeded from it. The reset clears RAM and
# reboots on a formatted chip: from it on dingbat runs the same frames at
# any programming time (101000/108368/115005 built), and mgba's and nba's
# frame counters are dingbat's.
# Everything after the reset is the timeline frozen on mgba/nba before it
# existed, 72 frames later (the reset's reboot ends on f166, the first boot's
# format on mgba's f94); the two START taps that fell in the format are gone.
# From f1884 (the game proper) 0x03004BD8 is an RNG that adds the VCOUNT it
# reads on every call, about once a line while the main loop waits (lines
# 6-13, ten calls a frame); 1-1's Shy Guys walk on its draws (0x08090070,
# from f4326), and no two emulators share it (dingbat's HLE and official
# BIOS neither: the HLE's SoftReset is 812 cycles short). shy_guys, column_top
# and below_white_block compare those draws: on this route mgba and nba are
# hit by a Shy Guy before column_top and dingbat is not.

[new]
wait 150
press A+B+SELECT+START hold=10
wait 32
tap START times=3 every=60 hold=4
wait 30
checkpoint title_menu window=30 compare=text
press A after=90
wait 4
wait 30
checkpoint choose_game window=30 compare=text
press A after=120
wait 664
wait 30
checkpoint yi_title window=30 compare=text
press START after=120
wait 4
wait 24
checkpoint file_menu window=30
press A after=180
wait 604
wait 20
checkpoint story window=10
tap A times=20 every=40 hold=6
tap A times=20 every=40 hold=6
wait 200
checkpoint stage_start window=0
press RIGHT hold=90 after=5
press A after=60
press RIGHT hold=90 after=5
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
press A after=40
checkpoint shy_guys window=0
wait 30
press RIGHT hold=30 after=5
press RIGHT hold=40 after=5
wait 10
wait 10
press B after=25
press DOWN hold=10 after=30
press RIGHT hold=20 after=2
press B after=25
press DOWN hold=10 after=30
press RIGHT hold=60 after=2
press RIGHT hold=90 after=2
hold RIGHT+A
wait 40
hold RIGHT
wait 30
release
hold RIGHT+A
wait 45
hold RIGHT
wait 12
release
checkpoint column_top window=0
hold RIGHT+A
wait 70
hold RIGHT
wait 20
release
checkpoint below_white_block window=0

